# (the first census reached only 306), 339 green, 8 red, 0 non-verdicts. These 8 are all in the
# stretch of shards 1, 4 and 9 that the stdin-eating suites had swallowed, so they had never been
# executed off-box at all — a reminder that the first census's 26 reds were never the whole list,
# only the part a truncated run could see.
